# Pattern-bound variables are injected into the TypeEnv for match arm bodies.
# [ok: v] binds v to the value of the ok field.
# The type checker must not emit "undefined variable: v" — v is in scope.
# With type narrowing: v gets the type of the ok field from the scrutinee Record.
[f: [fn [let x]
  [match x
    [case [let v] [ok: v] [+ v 1]]
    ...:                  0]]
 result: [f [ok: 41]]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(x), "result": Int(42)})
